# Feature planning (AI Plan)

Inject for planning:

1. Task / backlog / bug detail (L0)
2. **One** `docs/ai-plan/scopes/<module>.md` (L1)

Optional: `docs/product.md`, `docs/roadmap.md`, `docs/tech-stack.md` (L2). Use `docs/ai-plan/CODE_MAP.json` (L3) only after the plan names files.

Regenerate: `devjoy ai-plan`. Index: `docs/ai-plan/INDEX.md`.
